    "writeBoundary": "Live use is unavailable. Displayed release 1.0.999.738 is not an exact Android fingerprint/bootloader/SKU binding; no vendor unlock procedure, stock package hash, partition map, calibration backup, anti-rollback record, or local stock restore exists. The all-zero factory-package digest explicitly means unknown.",
    "liveDestructiveAllowed": false
  },
